<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Three%20BP%20measurements%20should%20be%20recorded%2C%201%E2%80%932%20min%20apart%2C%20and%20additional%20measurements%20if%20the%20first%20two%20readings%20differ%20by%20%3E10%20mmHg.%20BP%20is%20recorded%20as%20the%20average%20of%20the%20last%20two%20BP%20readings.> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalProcedure> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/MedicationEntity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
