<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/When%20using%20auscultatory%20methods%2C%20use%20phase%20I%20and%20V%20%28sudden%20reduction%2Fdisappearance%29%20Korotkoff%20sounds%20to%20identify%20SBP%20and%20DBP%2C%20respectively.> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceMention> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0006> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Measure BP in both arms at the first visit to detect possible between-arm differences. Use the arm with the higher value as the reference." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "EXPLICIT_LEXICAL" .
