<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/The%20cuff%20should%20be%20positioned%20at%20the%20level%20of%20the%20heart%20with%20the%20back%20and%20arm%20supported%2C%20to%20avoid%20muscle%20contraction%20and%20isometric-exercise-dependant%20increases%20in%20BP.> <http://digistrucmed.org/name> "The cuff should be positioned at the level of the heart with the back and arm supported, to avoid muscle contraction and isometric-exercise-dependant increases in BP." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0008/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
