<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/entityType> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/PROCEDURE_OR_INTERVENTION> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0007> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ExtractedEntity> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Three%20BP%20measurements%20should%20be%20recorded%2C%201%E2%80%932%20min%20apart%2C%20and%20additional%20measurements%20if%20the%20first%20two%20readings%20differ%20by%20%3E10%20mmHg.%20BP%20is%20recorded%20as%20the%20average%20of%20the%20last%20two%20BP%20readings.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Three BP measurements should be recorded, 1–2 min apart, and additional measurements if the first two readings differ by >10 mmHg. BP is recorded as the average of the last two BP readings." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_C> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence> .
