<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Record%20heart%20rate%20and%20use%20pulse%20palpation%20to%20exclude%20arrhythmia.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Record heart rate and use pulse palpation to exclude arrhythmia." .
