<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Patients%20should%20be%20seated%20comfortably%20in%20a%20quiet%20environment%20for%205%20min%20before%20BP%20measurements.> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceMention> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0001> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0010> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Record heart rate and use pulse palpation to exclude arrhythmia." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/relationConfidence> "0.98"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation_IIb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "IIb" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0006> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0006/normalization> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Three BP measurements should be recorded, 1–2 min apart, and additional measurements if the first two readings differ by >10 mmHg. BP is recorded as the average of the last two BP readings." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0006/locator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Locator> .
