<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0004/normalization> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/surfaceForm> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Measure%20BP%20in%20both%20arms%20at%20the%20first%20visit%20to%20detect%20possible%20between-arm%20differences.%20Use%20the%20arm%20with%20the%20higher%20value%20as%20the%20reference.> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0010/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Exact Table 14 instruction; conditions and measurement parameters remain verbatim in the broad procedural span." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Additional measurements may have to be performed in patients with unstable BP values due to arrhythmias, such as in patients with AF, in whom manual auscultatory methods should be used as most automated devices have not been validated for BP measurement in AF." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/recommendationStatus> "PRESENT" .
