<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormativeAssertion> <http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0003> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Use%20a%20standard%20bladder%20cuff%20%2812%E2%80%9313%20cm%20wide%20and%2035%20cm%20long%29%20for%20most%20patients%2C%20but%20use%20larger%20and%20smaller%20cuffs%20for%20larger%20%28arm%20circumference%20%3E32%20cm%29%20and%20smaller%20%28arm%20circumference%20%3C26%20cm%29%20arms%2C%20respectively.> <http://digistrucmed.org/name> "Use a standard bladder cuff (12–13 cm wide and 35 cm long) for most patients, but use larger and smaller cuffs for larger (arm circumference >32 cm) and smaller (arm circumference <26 cm) arms, respectively." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/spanConfidence> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormativeAssertion> <http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0002> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "EXPLICIT_LEXICAL" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0003/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/ValueEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Value Entity" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Measure%20BP%20in%20both%20arms%20at%20the%20first%20visit%20to%20detect%20possible%20between-arm%20differences.%20Use%20the%20arm%20with%20the%20higher%20value%20as%20the%20reference.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Measure BP in both arms at the first visit to detect possible between-arm differences. Use the arm with the higher value as the reference." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Exact Table 14 instruction; conditions and measurement parameters remain verbatim in the broad procedural span." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/Frequency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0009> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalProcedure> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/deonticForceBasis> "EXPLICIT_LEXICAL" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/ExtractedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Lying%20and%20standing%20BP%20measurements%20should%20also%20be%20considered%20in%20subsequent%20visits%20in%20older%20people%2C%20in%20people%20with%20DM%2C%20and%20in%20other%20conditions%20in%20which%20orthostatic%20hypotension%20may%20frequently%20occur.%20Initial%20orthostatic%20hypotension%20may%20occur%20%3C1%20min%20after%20standing%20and%20may%20be%20difficult%20to%20detect%20with%20conventional%20measurement%20techniques.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lying and standing BP measurements should also be considered in subsequent visits in older people, in people with DM, and in other conditions in which orthostatic hypotension may frequently occur. Initial orthostatic hypotension may occur <1 min after standing and may be difficult to detect with conventional measurement techniques." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasTextUnit> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0006> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalProcedure> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_C-EO> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/TestOrMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TestOrMeasurement" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasTextUnit> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0004> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Additional%20measurements%20may%20have%20to%20be%20performed%20in%20patients%20with%20unstable%20BP%20values%20due%20to%20arrhythmias%2C%20such%20as%20in%20patients%20with%20AF%2C%20in%20whom%20manual%20auscultatory%20methods%20should%20be%20used%20as%20most%20automated%20devices%20have%20not%20been%20validated%20for%20BP%20measurement%20in%20AF.> <http://digistrucmed.org/name> "Additional measurements may have to be performed in patients with unstable BP values due to arrhythmias, such as in patients with AF, in whom manual auscultatory methods should be used as most automated devices have not been validated for BP measurement in AF." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0004/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0002> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Three BP measurements should be recorded, 1–2 min apart, and additional measurements if the first two readings differ by >10 mmHg. BP is recorded as the average of the last two BP readings." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0002/normalization> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityNormalization> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/NormativeAssertion> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/DurationEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Duration Entity" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/MedicationEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Medication Entity" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClassOfRecommendation> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0009> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "When using auscultatory methods, use phase I and V (sudden reduction/disappearance) Korotkoff sounds to identify SBP and DBP, respectively." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0008> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0008> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/direction> "FOR" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0008> <http://digistrucmed.org/operation> "ASSESS" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0008> <http://digistrucmed.org/relationConfidence> "0.98"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Patients%20should%20be%20seated%20comfortably%20in%20a%20quiet%20environment%20for%205%20min%20before%20BP%20measurements.> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalProcedure> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14> <http://digistrucmed.org/sourceSemanticClass> "other_normative_clinical_instruction" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Record heart rate and use pulse palpation to exclude arrhythmia." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasTextUnit> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0005> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/semantic-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/SemanticUnit> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lying and standing BP measurements should also be considered in subsequent visits in older people, in people with DM, and in other conditions in which orthostatic hypotension may frequently occur. Initial orthostatic hypotension may occur <1 min after standing and may be difficult to detect with conventional measurement techniques." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0005/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
