<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/e_0008> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalProcedure> .
