<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/na_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/patientApplicability> "CONDITION_DEPENDENT" .
