<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/The%20cuff%20should%20be%20positioned%20at%20the%20level%20of%20the%20heart%20with%20the%20back%20and%20arm%20supported%2C%20to%20avoid%20muscle%20contraction%20and%20isometric-exercise-dependant%20increases%20in%20BP.> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The cuff should be positioned at the level of the heart with the back and arm supported, to avoid muscle contraction and isometric-exercise-dependant increases in BP." .
