<http://digistrucmed.org/entity/Additional%20measurements%20may%20have%20to%20be%20performed%20in%20patients%20with%20unstable%20BP%20values%20due%20to%20arrhythmias%2C%20such%20as%20in%20patients%20with%20AF%2C%20in%20whom%20manual%20auscultatory%20methods%20should%20be%20used%20as%20most%20automated%20devices%20have%20not%20been%20validated%20for%20BP%20measurement%20in%20AF.> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/SurfaceForm> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_1d4ae21bdadbacafa8087e019976dde180c346c5d4626772c2b286528336efac_table_14/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Three BP measurements should be recorded, 1–2 min apart, and additional measurements if the first two readings differ by >10 mmHg. BP is recorded as the average of the last two BP readings." .
